      "path": "src/ui/screens/ReviewOwedCard.tsx",
      "content": "Close Review statuses are still overridden by the preceding `dueNow \u003e 0` return. A closed trade with an overdue Position Change Reflection and a next-review, saved, or declined Close Review will display only “1 reflection due”, even after its detail loads. Resolve all available Close Review statuses before falling back to the generic reflection count, and cover these cases with a currently due Position Change Reflection.",
      "existing_code": "  if (closeReview?.classification === 'DueInNextReview') return 'Close Review · next Review';",
      "start_line": 27,
